{
  "schema": "iamar-style/1",
  "id": "iamar",
  "name": "iamar city (painted medieval)",
  "description": "The look of the iamar city: a painted, warm, lived-in medieval town. Hand-painted surfaces, warm saturated but not neon, detail from paint not geometry, nothing thin or flat, every visible thing closed, colours weathered toward lime plaster and old oak. Track A (iamar-family) worlds extend this profile.",
